           :     AggregateExec: mode=Partial, gby=[metadata.brand@0 as metadata.brand], aggr=[count(1) as agg_0]
           :       HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Inner, on=[(id@1, id@0)], projection=[metadata.brand@0]
           :         CooperativeExec
           :           PgSearchScan: table=ju, segments=3, fetch=[metadata.brand], visibility=eager, query={"exists":{"field":"name"}}
           :         CooperativeExec
